           taken as a packaging of CLDR 48.2); `uts35-sync` and an xtask test refuse any other.
           NOT vendored (owner, 2026-09-28, question 16; D13): `cargo xtask uts35-sync` fetches it
           into target/xtask-cache/uts35/ and checks it against the digests above; plans, code and
           tests paraphrase it and cite the section, and nothing in the tree quotes it
